('wikiloc', '14858967', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/pressa-de-caballers-pic-de-comaloforno-y-pic-de-besiberri-sud-24-09-2016-14858967', 'CABALLERS DAM, COMALOFORNO PEAK, AND BESIBERRI SOUTH PEAK 09/24/2016', '{"en":"Circular from Caballers Dam, Besiberri Sud","ca":"Circular des de la Presa de Caballers, Besiberri Sud","es":"Circular desde la Presa de Caballers, Besiberri Sud"}'::jsonb, 'PRESSA DE CABALLERS,PIC DE COMALOFORNO, Y PIC DE BESIBERRI SUD 24/09/2016 Hiking trail in Boí, Catalunya (España). Download its GPS track and follow the route on a map. Record your own itinerary from the Wikiloc app, upload the trail and share it with the community.', '{"en":"This difficult 12.8 km loop with 1324m of elevation gain starts from the Cavallers Dam, offering a direct ascent to two prominent peaks. The route is designed for experienced hikers seeking a challenging day in the high mountains.\n\nThe trail leads to the summit of Pic de Comaloforno, known for its panoramic views, and then continues to Pic de Besiberri Sud. The loop nature of the route brings hikers back to the Cavallers Dam, providing a rewarding high-mountain experience.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular difícil de 12.8 km amb 1324m de desnivell positiu comença des de la Presa de Cavallers, oferint un ascens directe a dos cims prominents. La ruta està dissenyada per a excursionistes experimentats que busquen un dia exigent a l''alta muntanya.\n\nEl camí condueix al cim del Pic de Comaloforno, conegut per les seves vistes panoràmiques, i després continua cap al Pic de Besiberri Sud. La naturalesa circular de la ruta retorna els excursionistes a la Presa de Cavallers, proporcionant una gratificant experiència d''alta muntanya.","es":"Esta ruta circular difícil de 12.8 km con 1324m de desnivel positivo comienza desde la Presa de Cavallers, ofreciendo un ascenso directo a dos cumbres prominentes. La ruta está diseñada para excursionistas experimentados que buscan un día exigente en la alta montaña.\n\nEl camino conduce a la cima del Pic de Comaloforno, conocido por sus vistas panorámicas, y luego continúa hacia el Pic de Besiberri Sud. La naturaleza circular de la ruta devuelve a los excursionistas a la Presa de Cavallers, proporcionando una gratificante experiencia de alta montaña."}'::jsonb, 'fum fum', 12826, 1324, 1324, 3016, 1698, 'difficult', 'loop', NULL, 50280, 1177, '2016-09-24', '2016-08', '[{"lat":42.583763,"lng":0.8544,"ele":1701.9},{"lat":42.583593,"lng":0.854295,"ele":1699.8},{"lat":42.583432,"lng":0.854207,"ele":1697.8},{"lat":42.58351,"lng":0.85427,"ele":1699},{"lat":42.58369,"lng":0.8542,"ele":1698.8},{"lat":42.583782,"lng":0.854178,"ele":1698.8},{"lat":42.583873,"lng":0.854155,"ele":1698.9},{"lat":42.583907,"lng":0.854272,"ele":1700.2},{"lat":42.583975,"lng":0.854353,"ele":1700.5},{"lat":42.584053,"lng":0.854425,"ele":1700.9},{"lat":42.584137,"lng":0.854473,"ele":1701.4},{"lat":42.584218,"lng":0.854538,"ele":1704.5},{"lat":42.58431,"lng":0.854537,"ele":1705.9},{"lat":42.584403,"lng":0.854518,"ele":1706.7},{"lat":42.58449,"lng":0.854478,"ele":1707.8},{"lat":42.584582,"lng":0.854433,"ele":1709.6},{"lat":42.584663,"lng":0.854352,"ele":1710.5},{"lat":42.584752,"lng":0.854307,"ele":1713.4},{"lat":42.584828,"lng":0.854227,"ele":1715.8},{"lat":42.584867,"lng":0.8541,"ele":1714},{"lat":42.584927,"lng":0.854008,"ele":1713.7},{"lat":42.584977,"lng":0.853907,"ele":1711.8},{"lat":42.585075,"lng":0.853878,"ele":1715.1},{"lat":42.585145,"lng":0.853955,"ele":1720.7},{"lat":42.58515,"lng":0.854085,"ele":1725.8},{"lat":42.585223,"lng":0.854165,"ele":1731.2},{"lat":42.585328,"lng":0.854245,"ele":1744.2},{"lat":42.585233,"lng":0.854228,"ele":1735.2},{"lat":42.58516,"lng":0.854302,"ele":1736.1},{"lat":42.585103,"lng":0.854397,"ele":1737.6},{"lat":42.585033,"lng":0.854483,"ele":1736},{"lat":42.584975,"lng":0.85459,"ele":1734.3},{"lat":42.584957,"lng":0.854712,"ele":1735.9},{"lat":42.584895,"lng":0.854815,"ele":1738},{"lat":42.58483,"lng":0.854907,"ele":1738.3},{"lat":42.