('wikiloc', '155823102', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/font-de-roca-pastora-collet-de-les-farigoles-i-mare-de-deu-del-mont-des-de-beuda-155823102', 'Font de Roca Pastora, Collet de les Farigoles, Falgars and Mare de Déu del Mont (100 peaks) from Beuda', '{"en":"Long Beuda loop via Falgars Castle","ca":"Circular llarga des de Beuda per Castell de Falgars","es":"Circular larga desde Beuda por Castillo de Falgars"}'::jsonb, 'Font de Roca Pastora, Collet de les Farigoles, Falgars i Mare de Déu del Mont (100 cim) des de Beuda Hiking trail in Beuda, Catalunya (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Ruta circular de dificultat dura. index ibp 82 HKG, des de Beuda passant per: 
- Mirador de les Envistes (0.8 km) 
- Mirador i placa de Salve Regina (1.4 km) 
- Font de Roca Pastora (2.0 km) 
- Mas de Roca Pastora (2.3 km) 
- Collet de les Farigoles (3.0 km) 
- Castell de Falgars (3.2 km) 
- Coll de Finestrelles (5.0 km) 
- Mare de Déu del Mont (5.8 km), 100 cim. 
- Collet de les Sorreres (6.1 km) 
- Monestir de Sant Llorenç de Sous (6.5 km) 
- Turó de les Grives (7.3 km) 
Temps en moviment correcte: 3 h i 9 minuts', '{"en":"This challenging 12.7 km loop from Beuda offers a significant 841m elevation gain, leading to Mare de Déu del Mont (1125m). The route passes several viewpoints and historical sites, starting with Mirador de les Envistes and Mirador i placa de Salve Regina in the initial kilometers.\n\nKey waypoints include Font de Roca Pastora, the ruins of Mas de Roca Pastora, Collet de les Farigoles, and Castell de Falgars. The trail continues to Coll de Finestrelles before reaching the sanctuary at Mare de Déu del Mont. The descent passes Collet de les Sorreres, the Monastery of Sant Llorenç de Sous, and Turó de les Grives, completing a demanding circuit.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular exigent de 12,7 km des de Beuda ofereix un desnivell considerable de 841m, conduint a la Mare de Déu del Mont (1125m). La ruta passa per diversos miradors i llocs històrics, començant amb el Mirador de les Envistes i el Mirador i placa de Salve Regina en els primers quilòmetres.\n\nEls punts clau inclouen la Font de Roca Pastora, les ruïnes del Mas de Roca Pastora, el Collet de les Farigoles i el Castell de Falgars. El sender continua fins al Coll de Finestrelles abans d''arribar al santuari de la Mare de Déu del Mont. El descens passa pel Collet de les Sorreres, el Monestir de Sant Llorenç de Sous i el Turó de les Grives, completant un circuit exigent.","es":"Esta ruta circular exigente de 12,7 km desde Beuda ofrece un desnivel considerable de 841m, conduciendo a la Mare de Déu del Mont (1125m). La ruta pasa por varios miradores y lugares históricos, comenzando con el Mirador de les Envistes y el Mirador y placa de Salve Regina en los primeros kilómetros.\n\nLos puntos clave incluyen la Font de Roca Pastora, las ruinas del Mas de Roca Pastora, el Collet de les Farigoles y el Castell de Falgars. El sendero continúa hasta el Coll de Finestrelles antes de llegar al santuario de la Mare de Déu del Mont. El descenso pasa por el Collet de les Sorreres, el Monasterio de Sant Llorenç de Sous y el Turó de les Grives, completando un circuito exigente."}'::jsonb, 'mtrill', 12714, 841, 841, 1117, 365, 'moderate', 'loop', 10320, 12540, 2153, '2023-12-15', '2023-11', '[{"lat":42.23969,"lng":2.713088,"ele":365.5},{"lat":42.239745,"lng":2.713116,"ele":365.7},{"lat":42.239788,"lng":2.713093,"ele":365.9},{"lat":42.239839,"lng":2.713079,"ele":366.1},{"lat":42.239892,"lng":2.71309,"ele":366.3},{"lat":42.239945,"lng":2.713108,"ele":366.3},{"lat":42.239964,"lng":2.713166,"ele":366.4},{"lat":42.240004,"lng":2.713202,"ele":366.6},{"lat":42.240053,"lng":2.713208,"ele":367.7},{"lat":42.240093,"lng":2.713262,"ele":369.2},{"lat":42.240125,"lng":2.713316,"ele":369.9},{"lat":42.240153,"lng":2.713377,"ele":370.4},{"lat":42.240178,"lng":2.713449,"ele":370.7},{"lat":42.240215,"lng":2.71349,"ele":370.4},{"lat":42.240256,"lng":2.713538,"ele":370.5},{"lat":42.240296,"lng":2.713586,"ele":370.5},{"lat":42.240338,"lng":2.713608,"ele":370.5},{"lat":42.240349,"lng":2.713668,"ele":370.5},{"lat":42.240371,"lng":2.713727,"ele":370.8},{"lat":42.24041,"lng":2.713773,"ele":371.2},{"lat":42.240454,"lng":2.713813,"ele":371.5},{"lat":42.240493,"lng":2.713847,"ele":371.8},{"lat":42.24053,"lng":2.713892,"ele":372.4},{"lat":42.240573,"lng":2.713917,"ele":373},{"lat":42.240617,"lng":2.713937,"ele":373.4},{"lat":42.240673,"lng":2.713925,"ele":373.6},{"lat":42.24072,"lng":2.713888,"ele":373.8},{"lat":42.240777,"lng":2.713885,"ele":373.8},{"lat":42.240818,"lng":2.71391,"ele":373.8},{"lat":42.240865,"lng":2.713929,"ele":373.4},{"lat":42.240915,"lng":2.71393,"ele":372.7},{"lat":42.240962,"lng":2.713942,"ele":372.4},{"lat":42.241007,"lng":2.713987,"ele":372.2},{"lat":42.241054,"lng":2.714025,"ele":372},{"lat":42.241108,"lng":2.714055,"ele":371.9},{"lat":42.241161,"lng":2.714063,"ele":371.7},{"lat":42.241199,"lng":2.714097,"ele":371.5},{"lat":42.241256,"lng":2.714116,"ele":371.3},{"lat":42.241316,"lng":2.714125,"ele":371.3},{"lat":42.241343,"lng":2.71419,"ele":371.4},