('wikiloc', '15993018', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/01-17-serra-de-miralles-esglesia-i-castell-coll-tresserres-creu-ferro-agulla-grossa-i-grony-balc-fo-15993018', '01/17 Miralles Mountain Range: Church and Castle-Coll Tresserres-Creu Ferro-Agulla Grossa and Grony-Balç Fontanilles | Anoia {580+}', '{"en":"Miralles Church and Castle circular","ca":"Circular Església i Castell de Miralles","es":"Circular Iglesia y Castillo de Miralles"}'::jsonb, '01/17 Serra de Miralles : Església i Castell-Coll Tresserres-Creu Ferro-Agulla Grossa i Grony-Balç Fontanilles | Anoia {580+} Hiking trail in Sant Martí de Tous, Catalunya (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. CompeGps Land 
