('wikiloc', '160050371', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/gosol-pedraforca-pollego-superior-coll-del-verdet-font-terrers-gosol-160050371', 'Gósol - Pedraforca Pollegó Superior - Coll del Verdet - Font Terrers - Gósol', '{"en":"Long one way from Gósol","ca":"Un sol sentit llarg des de Gósol","es":"Un solo sentido largo desde Gósol"}'::jsonb, 'Gósol - Pedraforca Pollegó Superior - Coll del Verdet - Font Terrers - Gósol Hiking trail in Gósol, Catalunya (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. From the parking in Gósol take the path into the forest. It''s very steep once you get into the forest. 

Once you come out of the forest it''s gets a bit rocky then it comes to a very steep scree slope. The scree slope is difficult and you need to be careful with your footing. 

At the top in the pass between the 2 peaks turn to the left and you''ll need to do some rock climbing to get to the peak. 

On the way down its a bit tricky and you''ll need to climb down the peak, sometimes backwards. You''ll need to go and over three peaks walking along the ridge. At one point there is a rope before you get to the Coll del Verdet. 

At the Coll del Verdet you''ll walk along another ridge. At one point you''ll need to decide if you want to go down to Gósol or through the forest to the Area recreativa font Terrers. It''s very steep downhill. From the Font it''s about 2kms back to Gósol. 

We went up to the castle in Gósol after. It''s a short walk up hill from town.', '{"en":"This challenging one-way route to Pollegó Superior starts from Gósol, immediately entering a very steep forest section. After exiting the forest, the terrain becomes rocky, leading to a difficult and steep scree slope requiring careful footing.\n\nAt the pass between the two peaks, turn left for a rock-climbing section to the summit. The descent from the peak is tricky, involving downclimbing, sometimes backwards, across three peaks along a ridge. A rope assists before Coll del Verdet. From Coll del Verdet, hikers can descend directly to Gósol or via the Font Terrers recreational area, both routes being very steep downhill.","ca":"Aquesta ruta exigent d''anada al Pollegó Superior comença des de Gósol, entrant immediatament en un tram de bosc molt pronunciat. Després de sortir del bosc, el terreny es torna rocós, conduint a una tartera difícil i molt inclinada que requereix una trepitjada acurada.\n\nAl coll entre els dos cims, gireu a l''esquerra per un tram d''escalada en roca fins al cim. El descens des del cim és complicat, implicant desgrimpar, de vegades d''esquena, per tres cims al llarg d''una carena. Una corda ajuda abans del Coll del Verdet. Des del Coll del Verdet, els excursionistes poden baixar directament a Gósol o per l''àrea recreativa de Font Terrers, sent ambdues rutes molt pronunciades en el descens.","es":"Esta ruta exigente de ida al Pollegó Superior comienza desde Gósol, entrando inmediatamente en un tramo de bosque muy pronunciado. Después de salir del bosque, el terreno se vuelve rocoso, conduciendo a una tartera difícil y muy inclinada que requiere una pisada cuidadosa.\n\nEn el collado entre las dos cimas, gire a la izquierda para un tramo de escalada en roca hasta la cumbre. El descenso desde la cima es complicado, implicando destrepar, a veces de espaldas, por tres cimas a lo largo de una cresta. Una cuerda ayuda antes del Coll del Verdet. Desde el Coll del Verdet, los excursionistas pueden descender directamente a Gósol o por el área recreativa de Font Terrers, siendo ambas rutas muy pronunciadas en el descenso."}'::jsonb, 'Brad De Abreu', 13052, 1172, 1157, 2507, 1417, 'difficult', 'one-way', 14040, 21960, 2293, '2024-02-02', '2024-01', '[{"lat":42.234868,"lng":1.663082,"ele":1417.1},{"lat":42.234919,"lng":1.66309,"ele":1419.1},{"lat":42.234964,"lng":1.663105,"ele":1419.1},{"lat":42.235006,"lng":1.663128,"ele":1419.1},{"lat":42.235054,"lng":1.66311,"ele":1419.1},{"lat":42.235098,"lng":1.66308,"ele":1418.6},{"lat":42.235149,"lng":1.663058,"ele":1418.1},{"lat":42.235197,"lng":1.663047,"ele":1417.1},{"lat":42.235253,"lng":1.663049,"ele":1417.1},{"lat":42.235304,"lng":1.663051,"ele":1417.1},{"lat":42.235359,"lng":1.663039,"ele":1417.1},{"lat":42.235406,"lng":1.663027,"ele":1417.1},{"lat":42.235416,"lng":1.663091,"ele":1417.1},{"lat":42.235378,"lng":1.663021,"ele":1417.1},{"lat":42.235332,"lng":1.663024,"ele":1417.1},{"lat":42.235375,"lng":1.663002,"ele":1418.1},{"lat":42.235426,"lng":1.66302,"ele":1418.1},{"lat":42.235454,"lng":1.663082,"ele":1419.1},{"lat":42.235488,"lng":1.663144,"ele":1419.1},{"lat":42.235513,"lng":1.663201,"ele":1419.1},{"lat":42.235548,"lng":1.66324,"ele":1420.1},{"lat":42.235592,"lng":1.663288,"ele":1420.1},{"lat":42.235629,"lng":1.663351,"ele":1420.1},{"lat":42.235671,"lng":1.663386,"ele":1420.1},{"lat":42.235707,"lng":1.663431,"ele":1420.1},{"lat":42.235745,"lng":1.663475,"ele":1419.6},{"lat":42.235773,"lng":1.663547,"ele":1420.1},{"lat":42.235801,"lng":1.6636,"ele":1420.1},{"lat":42.235831,"lng":1.663653,"ele":1420.1},{"lat":42.235868,"lng":1.663693,"ele":1420.1},{"lat":42.23589,"lng":1.66375,"ele":1421.1},{"lat":42.235852,"lng":1.663806,"ele":1422.1},{"lat":42.235823,"lng":1.66386,"ele":1422.1},{"lat":42.235793,"lng":1.663948,"ele":1422.1},{"lat":42.235773,"lng":1.664006,"ele":1422.1},{"lat":42.235761,"lng":1.664065,"ele":1422.1},{"lat":42.235762,"lng":1.664136,"ele":1422.1},{"lat":42.235